/* SEGMENT 6: OUTRO_CTA [3:30-3:55]                                  */
/* emotion_curve: INSIGHT → SELF-AWARENESS                           */
/* narrative_stage: OUTRO_CTA                                        */
/* ================================================================ */

/* visual_type: character_reaction | space: desk */

INT. VEE'S ROOM - NIGHT

= Vee at her desk. One monitor now. She opens an AI chat. But before typing, she pauses. Pulls out her notebook. Writes three bullet points. Looks at them. Nods. Then types.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Five mistakes. Five fixes. None of them require better AI. All of them require ten seconds of thinking before you type.

/* vee_reaction: 6/6 */

= Vee posts a checklist next to her monitor. Five items. She checks off the first one before starting her next session: "Did I write what I want?"

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Slow down for ten seconds. The AI will wait.

> END CARD: 구독 + "다음 편: 이 영상은 AI가 만들었다"

= FADE TO BLACK.

